k the seven kingdoms  viserys had seven descendants who will  also play a major role  counsel down is already well versed in  medieval intrigue having played banco in  the 2015 hollywood film macbeth  one of the main roles in the series will  be occupied by princess rhaenyra  targaryen  she was the first born of the king and  of pure valyrian blood she liked to  dress herself like the warrior queen  visenya targaryen the wife of aenon the  conqueror plus she was a dragon rider  herself specifically that of the  she-dragon cyrax  in the series rene is embodied by emma  darcy  up to now she has mostly played small  roles house of the dragon could thus be  her breakthrough in the world of acting  alison hightower the second wife of king  viserys also has an important role to  play she was the daughter of otto  hightower who was the hand of a total of  three rulers she grew up in the red keep  and was considered the most beautiful  woman in the seven kingdoms at the age  of 18 she married the king to whom she  gave four children  ellison is played by olivia cook she is  best known from the drama sound of metal  the blockbuster ready player 1 and the  series bates motel  prince daemon targaryen was the younger  brother of vasiris unlike his sibling he  was not known for his easygoing and  cheerful nature but more for his  swordsmanship  he was one of the greatest heroes of his  time and will of the long sword dark  sister which of course was made of  valerian steel after two marriages  without a son he finally entered into  marriage with his niece princess  rhaenyra  together they had two sons aegon iii and  vasiris ii  daemon is played by matt smith he's  surely known to many of us as doctor who  and of course prince philip in the  series the crown  otto hightower the hand of the king was  a loyal supporter of the kingdom  he served a total of three kings as hand  although two of them dismissed him as  the father of the listened hightower he  joined her in trying to assert his  grandson's claim to the throne which  eventually led to his deposition he saw  prince daemon targaryen as his greatest  rival as well as a threat to the kingdom  it was not only his wild warlike nature  that displeased the hand rumor has it  that he also deflowered his daughter  otto is played by rhys ivans who most of  you know as the father of lunar lovegood  from harry potter  carlos valerion also known as the sea  snake will feature in the series as well  house velaryon originated an ancient  valyria and settled in the seven  kingdoms as a feudal house of the  targaryens coles for his part went down  in the history of westeros as the most  famous navigator ever he's said to have  led his house to such wealth that they  possessed even more gold than the  lannisters moreover he's believed to  have been in command of the largest  fleet of all time he was the husband of  rennes targaryen who was known among the  common people as the queen who never was  corliss is played by steve tucson he's  known from the video game adaption  prince of persia the sans of time  reign is valerian the wife of corliss is  also likely to be seen often the queen  who never was was simply passed over by  the great council when it came to  choosing a successor to the iron throne  since the council did not want a woman  to be in charge of the seven kingdoms  she was the writer of the dragon males  and a feared warrior in the series she  is played by eve best the british  actress was last seen the netflix  production fade the wings saga what  would a game of thrones series be  without people from the free cities  pulling the strings behind the scenes in  house of the dragon that's missouria the  beautiful dancer from lisz was sold from  one slave trader to the next until she  finally ended up in a brothel in king's  landing it was there that damon  targaryen took notice of her and made  her his mistress  sonoyo mizuno will be playing the role  of missouria finally there's sir kristen  cole he was the simple son of the  steward of house dondarium he became  known for his sword skills rising to the  rank of lord commander of the kingsguard  fabian frankel who recently appeared in  the netflix production the serpent will  take on the role of coal  finally let's move on to the plot here  the new series has a decisive advantage  over its forerunner the story has  already been concluded needless to say  we won't reveal the entire story we will  only briefly cover it as we can tell  from the characters the series takes  place about 150 years prior to the  events of the original series this means  that the happening surrounding egg and  the conqueror will at most be shown in  flashbacks the story of the dance of the  dragons will be narrated this describes  the civil war between the two opposing  parties from the house of targaryen on  the one side is alison hightower who  wants to see her son aegon ii succeed to  the throne after viserys death on the  other side is rhaenyra targaryen the  first born child of the late king who  would be the heiress according to the  official succession  this gives rise to two parties which  call themselves the greens and the black  council this civil war will go down in  the history of westeros as one of the  bloodiest to which most dragons will  succumb  the first season will probably tell the  power political prehistory to the dance  of the dragons  for as you may have noticed an important  cast has not yet been announced that of  again the second also the show is not  supposed to be as brutal as the original  series  this is mainly due to the public  criticism of the downplayed sexual  violence against women in game of  thrones  whether the prequel will match the  quality of the old episodes remains to  be seen  after all the show took 8 seasons to  develop complex characters however the  creators have shown a season 8 that they  can also end the series in a flash  filming on house of the dragon has  meanwhile began at levinson studios in  london as opposed to northern ireland  and croatia as was the case with the  previous series  the plan is to finish post-production by  the end of the year of course george r.r  martin is again present as a consultant  however it is doubtful whether he will  be able to devote much time to the  project  after all he also wishes to finish the  story of his song of ice and fire in his  own words ryan condle who previously  worked on hercules and on rampage was  signed on as a showrunner he will be  assisted by battle of the bastards  director miguel sapochnick thus the two  will take over the duties of d.b wise  and david benioff who are the focus of  criticism after this season 8 fiasco  most importantly fans can look forward  to return of composer rameen jawadi who  famously composed the music for game of  thrones the first season will include 10  episodes although nothing is known about  the over length so far the budget has  also not been disclosed however one  episode of the last season costs an  average 15 million us dollars the series  will be released in 2022 but it is not  clear yet whether it will be on the  first or second half of the year  alright that's it for our preview of  house of the dragon what do you think  have you been able to get over the  frustration of season 8 and are you now  ready for new adventures from westeros  or are you still so fed up that you  won't even watch the new series we  believe that at least the story offers  great potential and could result in a  good show as long as the creators at hbo  have learned from past mistakes let us  know what you guys have to say in the  comments it is clear however that this  will not be the last series in the end  there will be a total of 6 series from  the game of thrones universe next  project is a series about the tales of  dunk and egg these are stories about the  lord commander of the kingsguard lord  duncan and egan targaryen v  we are excited  see you next time 